# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Ask demo (src/lib/ask/gemini.ts, called from src/components/islands/AskAI.tsx)
#
# Copy to `.env` for local dev and set the same values in your host's dashboard
# for production. `.env` is git-ignored.
#
# ⚠ THE PUBLIC_ PREFIX IS INTENTIONAL AND IT MEANS THIS KEY IS PUBLISHED.
#
# Astro inlines every PUBLIC_* var into the browser bundle, so this key is
# readable by anyone who opens devtools on the deployed site. That is the
# accepted trade-off here — the demo calls Gemini straight from the browser so
# the site can stay 100% static, with no serverless function to deploy.
#
# It is only acceptable while BOTH of these hold:
#   1. The key belongs to a Gemini FREE-TIER project with NO billing account
#      linked. Then the worst case is a 429 and the demo falling back to its
#      curated presets — it cannot produce a bill.
#   2. The key is RESTRICTED in Google Cloud to the Generative Language API
#      only, so a leak cannot reach any other API enabled on that project:
#      console.cloud.google.com → APIs & Services → Credentials → the key →
#      "API restrictions" → Restrict key → Generative Language API.
#
# If billing is ever enabled on that project, revert this the same day: move the
# call back behind a server route reading a non-PUBLIC key.
#
# Note: HTTP-referrer restrictions are NOT a substitute. `Referer` is sent by
# the client and can be forged with one curl flag. They are friction, not
# security. Rotate the key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey instead.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Gemini API key — https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
PUBLIC_GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to gemini-3.6-flash.
#
# Do NOT set this to a gemini-2.5-* model. They still show up in ListModels but
# the API rejects them for accounts created after their deprecation:
#   404 "no longer available to new users ... use models/gemini-3.6-flash"
# PUBLIC_GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.6-flash
